【My Computer】 for windows10 is back!

[New Features] Mobile phone scanning code to play videos in the computer.

The touch screen device is more friendly: it is tailored for the touch screen Windows 10 in the traditional mouse and keyboard mode, and is easier to use;

Tabbed browsing mode: no need to worry about switching, as easy as browsing the web;

Folders are always available for collection: Common folder browsing is more intuitive;

Go to the traditional mode: one-click to open the system path, the traditional mode is also taken care of.
